# Whether the scope of a function is handed back where nothing keeps it does not hang on how many calls of the function the program holds.
# The scope holds a text, so it is not promoted. The twin, ..-is-called-twice.ir, is this program and one call more: the check lines on `plain` are the same. f1 = plain
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: ReleaseEnvironment
# RUN(PROMOTED): compile EnvironmentsPromotedToVariables mechanisms=all
# PROMOTED: statistic EnvironmentsPromotedToVariables 0
